    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pinball Lovers Rejoice!</h2>Love pinball? Have you ever wanted to design your own pinball machine and play it? You can do all of that and more with PinBuilder!<br><br><br>PinBuilder is more than a pinball game, it's a pinball simulator that gives you the power to design and construct your own pinball playfield designs. Want to put ten flippers on the playfield? You can do that! Want to put 100 drop targets? Do that too! How many multiballs can you use? CLUE: As many as you want! The only limits are your imagination and your computer power! And once you're satisfied with your design, share it with other PinBuilders around the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here's what you can do with PinBuilder</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play the most realistic pinball simulation, on your PC<br></li><li>Re-design them to your liking<br></li><li>Share your playfield designs on the Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Download and play playfield designs created by other players</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pinball Lovers Rejoice!</h2>Love pinball? Have you ever wanted to design your own pinball machine and play it? You can do all of that and more with PinBuilder!<br><br><br>PinBuilder is more than a pinball game, it's a pinball simulator that gives you the power to design and construct your own pinball playfield designs. Want to put ten flippers on the playfield? You can do that! Want to put 100 drop targets? Do that too! How many multiballs can you use? CLUE: As many as you want! The only limits are your imagination and your computer power! And once you're satisfied with your design, share it with other PinBuilders around the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here's what you can do with PinBuilder</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play the most realistic pinball simulation, on your PC<br></li><li>Re-design them to your liking<br></li><li>Share your playfield designs on the Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Download and play playfield designs created by other players</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Have you ever wanted to design your own pinball machine? Then build it? And then play it? You can do all of that and more with PinBuilder!",
